  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Bundles custom CSS into khamsin.css: khamsin.json's css files and referenced libraries' stylesheets are emitted in the base layer between theme and utilities, so consumers link one stylesheet. Emits a Tailwind-compatible preflight in the base layer, extracts class attributes from render fragments declared in @code blocks, accepts fully qualified Khamsin.Cn/Khamsin.Kx calls, adds visible/invisible utilities and animate-in fade defaults, and fixes negative fraction utilities plus the attribute emitter and metadata reader.",
